<title>JAPAN: JGB futures fall one full point after BOJ comments.</title>
<headline>JGB futures fall one full point after BOJ comments.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The key June 10-year Japanese government bond (JGB) futures contract fell one full point to 123.50 after remarks on interest rates by the Bank of Japan deputy-governor on Wednesday afternoon.</p>
<p>June JGBs fell as low as 123.45, against Tuesday's finish of 124.50.</p>
